      <marc:subfield code="a">Set in in China in 1941, a railroad worker (Chan) leads his ragtag group of freedom fighters against the Japanese in order to get food for the poor. They soon find themselves on the wrong side of the tracks when they decide to ambush a heavily armed military train filled with desperately needed provisions. Unarmed and outnumbered, they must fight back against an entire army using only their wits.</marc:subfield>
